# Block-list URLs — one per line. Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored.
#
# StevenBlack/hosts is a meta-list that already merges several reputable
# upstream lists (AdAway, MVPS, Disconnect, etc.). Single source of truth
# for now; add more lists here later if a specific gap shows up (e.g. via
# a "this domain wasn't blocked" report from Technitium).
#
# Validated 2026-05-12: ~82,623 blocked entries, standard /etc/hosts format
# (`0.0.0.0 <domain>`), last upstream commit 2026-05-08.
#
# Format note: Technitium auto-detects the upstream format (hosts file,
# domain-only list, ABP/AdBlock filter syntax); no transformation needed
# in the Ansible role.

https://raw.githubusercontent.com/StevenBlack/hosts/master/hosts
